    "background_story": "Iliana was a brilliant and curious scientist who spent most of her career studying the mysteries of light and energy. Her fascination with the radiometer, a device that measures the intensity of radiation, led her to make groundbreaking discoveries in the field of solar energy. Iliana's work focused on optimizing the design of radiometers to harness the power of the sun more efficiently. Her innovative approach and tireless experimentation earned her international recognition, and she became a leading expert in her field. Iliana's passion for science was contagious, inspiring a new generation of researchers to explore the possibilities of renewable energy. Her legacy continued to shine bright, illuminating the path to a more sustainable future.",
